`src/services/captcha/generator.rs` is a derivative work of the `captcha-rs`
crate, v0.5.0. It was vendored so that CaptchAPI can select the `image`
feature set directly (upstream forces `image/default`, which pulls in every
image codec) and so that the proprietary font upstream embeds could be
replaced — see "Embedded Fonts" below.

